' Diagram 5: Listing statuses
@startuml 05-listing-statuses
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> DRAFT : create listing
DRAFT --> PUBLISHED : owner publish\n(needs a room)
PUBLISHED --> PAUSED : owner pause
PAUSED --> PUBLISHED : owner resume\n(needs a room)
PUBLISHED --> DRAFT : last room deleted

DRAFT --> SUSPENDED : admin suspend OR\nowner blocked
PUBLISHED --> SUSPENDED : admin suspend OR\nowner blocked
PAUSED --> SUSPENDED : admin suspend OR\nowner blocked

SUSPENDED --> DRAFT : restore (was DRAFT)
SUSPENDED --> PUBLISHED : restore (was PUBLISHED)
SUSPENDED --> PAUSED : restore (was PAUSED)

note right of SUSPENDED
  Stores statusBeforeSuspension and a source:
  ADMIN -> only an admin "unsuspend" restores it
  OWNER_BLOCKED -> only unblocking the owner restores it
  The owner can never publish, pause or resume it.
end note
@enduml